   "text": "kubeadm init / join writes\nconfig.yaml, kubelet.conf\nand kubeadm-flags.env\n\n-> step 3 never happens\n-> kubelet stays running\n-> NRestarts stops",
   "originalText": "kubeadm init / join writes\nconfig.yaml, kubelet.conf\nand kubeadm-flags.env\n\n-> step 3 never happens\n-> kubelet stays running\n-> NRestarts stops",
